<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on Ciba Specialty Chemicals.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Ciba Specialty Chemicals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Ciba Specialty Chemicals.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1.30 CHF		  PREMIUM	14.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.58 CHF		  GEARING	8 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   18.SEP.98		 PAYDATE	26.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  127 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
